    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:intimidate|dc:22|name:Cow Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Twice to Cow the Spirit, @Check[type:religion|dc:20|name: Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Twice to Quiet the Spirit,&nbsp;</p>\n<p>@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name: Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Twice to Quiet the Spirit,&nbsp;</p>\n<p>@Check[type:stealth|dc:22|name:Smell Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Once To Smell Burnt Fur,</p>",
      "description": "<p>A manticore lurches to life, its face shifting to that of a weeping woman as its fur erupts into flames.</p>",
      "reset": "<p><strong>Burnlnq Stinger Reaction</strong>. (Attack, Fire]<strong> Trigger</strong> Valid creature that has entered B2 previously enters B2 again; The haunt rolls its stealth against a valid target&rsquo;s Perception DC. On a success the batting marrticore makes a burning tail strike. After the attack or after a failure the Burning Marticore rolls initiative.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong>Routine</strong>&nbsp;The haunt moves toward its target at a speed of 40 feet. If it has any actions left after its movement it makes a strike against its target. If the target is struck successfully, it must make a&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:reflex|dc:25|name:Lured to Ashes Fire|traits:damaging-effect,fire,necromancy,occult]&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">save or catch fire.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Burning</strong> [Fire] A creature that fails its&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">@Check[type:reflex|dc:25|name:Lured to Ashes Fire|traits:damaging-effect,fire,necromancy,occult] </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">save, when struck by the Stinger take</span>s [[/r 1d8[persistent,fire]]] damage. <strong>Source</strong> Stinger</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
    },
